{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Amazon 為 MacBook Air 13 吋（M5）帶來優惠，主要型號 16GB / 512GB 減價 19%，入手價為 US$1049。其他型號方面，13 吋 16GB / 1TB 售 US$1349，15 吋 16GB / 512GB 售 US$1249，15 吋 16GB / 1TB 售 US$1549。新機配備 M5 晶片與 16GB 統一記憶體起，應對日常文書、剪輯與 Apple Intelligence 應用更從容。若正考慮換機，現時價位值得把握。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"MacBook Air 15 吋（M5）午夜黑色\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/41Agoc2yia-L.jpg\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n<h2>MacBook Air 13 吋（M5） 重點功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>M5 晶片效能</strong>：M5 晶片帶來更快的 CPU 與統一記憶體，配合新一代 GPU 的神經加速器及更強 Neural Engine，處理 Apple Intelligence 與多工剪輯時更流暢，日常多開應用亦有實際幫助。</li>\n<li><strong>最長 18 小時續航</strong>：Amazon 頁面標示最長 18 小時續航，足以應付一日工作或上課，外出時可減少攜帶電源適配器的需要，對經常移動辦公的用家更省事。</li>\n<li><strong>接駁與無線齊全</strong>：機身提供兩個 Thunderbolt 4、MagSafe 充電與耳機孔，內建 Apple N1 晶片支援 Wi-Fi 7 及藍牙 6，並可同時外接兩個顯示器，接駁周邊與擴展工作桌面更方便。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR1JTFP8?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple 2026 MacBook Air 13-inch Laptop with M5 chip: Built for AI, 13.6-inch Liquid Retina Display, 16GB Unified Memory, 512GB SSD, 12MP Center Stage Camera, Touch ID, Wi-Fi 7; Midnight\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZqZQY3BjL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR1JTFP8?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple 2026 MacBook Air 13-inch Laptop with M5 chip: Built for AI, 13.6-inch Liquid Retina Display, 16GB Unified Memory, 512GB SSD, 12MP Center Stage Camera, Touch ID, Wi-Fi 7; Midnight</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$1,049.00</p>\n<p>$1,299.00</p>\n<p>-19%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR1JTFP8?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR1FSY63?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple 2026 MacBook Air 13-inch Laptop with M5 chip: Built for AI, 13.6-inch Liquid Retina Display, 16GB Unified Memory, 1TB SSD, 12MP Center Stage Camera, Touch ID, Wi-Fi 7; Midnight\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZqZQY3BjL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR1FSY63?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple 2026 MacBook Air 13-inch Laptop with M5 chip: Built for AI, 13.6-inch Liquid Retina Display, 16GB Unified Memory, 1TB SSD, 12MP Center Stage Camera, Touch ID, Wi-Fi 7; Midnight</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$1,349.00</p>\n<p>$1,599.00</p>\n<p>-16%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR1FSY63?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR114BV7?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple 2026 MacBook Air 15-inch Laptop with M5 chip: Built for AI, 15.3-inch Liquid Retina Display, 16GB Unified Memory, 512GB SSD, 12MP Center Stage Camera, Touch ID, Wi-Fi 7; Midnight\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Agoc2yiaL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR114BV7?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple 2026 MacBook Air 15-inch Laptop with M5 chip: Built for AI, 15.3-inch Liquid Retina Display, 16GB Unified Memory, 512GB SSD, 12MP Center Stage Camera, Touch ID, Wi-Fi 7; Midnight</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$1,249.00</p>\n<p>$1,499.00</p>\n<p>-17%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR114BV7?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR1BJ72L?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple 2026 MacBook Air 15-inch Laptop with M5 chip: Built for AI, 15.3-inch Liquid Retina Display, 16GB Unified Memory, 1TB SSD, 12MP Center Stage Camera, Touch ID, Wi-Fi 7; Midnight\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Agoc2yiaL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR1BJ72L?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple 2026 MacBook Air 15-inch Laptop with M5 chip: Built for AI, 15.3-inch Liquid Retina Display, 16GB Unified Memory, 1TB SSD, 12MP Center Stage Camera, Touch ID, Wi-Fi 7; Midnight</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$1,549.00</p>\n<p>$1,799.00</p>\n<p>-14%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR1BJ72L?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>為什麼會顯示沒有貨？</h2>\n<p>如果大家的 Amazon 帳號設定了本地地址，這樣當顯示美國限定產品時是會顯示「沒有供應」，然而大家只要輸入一些<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/2019/05/06/buy-and-ship/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">集運公司的地址</a>，這樣就可以正常顯示價格及送貨。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Amazon 美國送貨地址設定\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"868\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/amazon-us-address.jpg\" width=\"1630\"/></figure>\n<h2>購買美版的 AppleCare 保修問題</h2>\n<p>不少人也對海外購買 Apple 產品的保修有疑問，其實 Apple 產品很多時也是全球性維修，不過 AppleCare+ 的意外換機則必須要原來的購買地才可。那就是你不能買美國版 AppleCare+ 在香港／台灣要求意外更換，必須要在美國更換。不過，維修一般沒有問題，當然每個地區的 Apple Store 也有其不同的。</p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T23:24:23.365839+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1723,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T15:16:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T07:17:43.913238+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T23:17:54.966536+00:00","content_hash":"febcda7c40ec911da3139ba78d09421706a8d71085e2bbd6577d00fbbd7aa00e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}